ont-size=\"21\" fill=\"#555555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">但若措施提前解除，可能迎来更高的第二波——情景 C 解除后的峰值是措施期内最高值的 3.6 倍</text>\n<line x1=\"60\" y1=\"310\" x2=\"1540\" y2=\"310\" stroke=\"#141414\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n<line x1=\"440\" y1=\"330\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"960\" stroke=\"#141414\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/>\n<line x1=\"1110\" y1=\"330\" x2=\"1110\" y2=\"960\" stroke=\"#141414\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/>\n</g>\n<g id=\"layer4\" inkscape:groupmode=\"layer\" inkscape:label=\"模型\">\n<text x=\"60\" y=\"360\" font-family=\"'Noto Serif CJK SC', serif\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#141414\">模型</text>\n<rect x=\"70\" y=\"388\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#141414\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"105\" y=\"430\" font-family=\"'Noto Serif CJK SC', serif\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#141414\" text-anchor=\"middle\">S</text>\n<text x=\"105\" y=\"480\" font-family=\"'Noto Serif CJK SC', serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">易感者</text>\n<line x1=\"142\" y1=\"423\" x2=\"153.6\" y2=\"423\" stroke=\"#141414\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<path d=\"M160.0,423.0 L152.7,426.3 L152.7,419.7 Z\" fill=\"#141414\"/>\n<rect x=\"162\" y=\"388\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#141414\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"197\" y=\"430\" font-family=\"'Noto Serif CJK SC', serif\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"900\" fill=\"#141414\" text-anchor=\"middle\">E</text>\n<text x=\"197\" y=\"480\" font-family=\"'Noto Serif CJK SC', serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#555555\" text-anchor=\"middle\">潜伏者</text>\n<line x1=\"234\" y1=\"423\" x2=\"245.6\" y2=\"423\" stroke=\"#141414\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n<path d=\"M252.0,423.0 L244.7,426.3 L244.7,419.7 Z\" fill=\"#141414\"/>\n<rect x=\"254\" y=\"388\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#141414\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<text x=\"289\" y=\"430\" font-family=\"'Noto Serif CJK SC', serif\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"9